Warning [L0201]: implicit clone of `msg`; write `^msg` to transfer ownership or `.clone()` to silence this warning
  --> tests/ui_lint/implicit_clone.jet:6:13
    |
  6 |     consume(msg)
    |             ^^^
 Why: `consume` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: write `^msg` to move, or `msg.clone()` to copy explicitly
